WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:01.878
- Do I look unhealthy?

00:00:01.878 --> 00:00:03.395
Take a look at this physique.

00:00:03.395 --> 00:00:05.657
I'm in phenomenal shape, in body and mind.

00:00:05.657 --> 00:00:07.439
People say a loss can
make or break a fighter.

00:00:07.439 --> 00:00:10.637
But trust me, a win can also
make or break a fighter.

00:00:10.637 --> 00:00:13.098
If you can see it here,

00:00:13.098 --> 00:00:16.296
and you have the courage
enough to speak it,

00:00:16.296 --> 00:00:17.173
it will happen.

00:00:17.173 --> 00:00:18.529
Nobody works harder than me.

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:22.916
Inside the octagon, outside
the octagon, I am a workhorse.

00:00:22.916 --> 00:00:23.758
I knew what was going to happen.

00:00:23.758 --> 00:00:24.611
I knew I was going to get here.

00:00:24.611 --> 00:00:25.444
They didn't.

00:00:25.444 --> 00:00:27.182
It was a lot of stressful years.

00:00:27.182 --> 00:00:29.003
A lot of tough times.

00:00:29.003 --> 00:00:31.244
Every gym had their set
way of doing things.

00:00:31.244 --> 00:00:33.930
Don't do it this way, do it that way.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:36.226
I always felt grateful
for even the small things.

00:00:36.226 --> 00:00:37.962
I always used to celebrate
the small things.

00:00:37.962 --> 00:00:42.146
And I slipped a punch and
I shuffled my shoulders

00:00:42.146 --> 00:00:43.897
and I said, "Muhammad Ali!"

00:00:43.897 --> 00:00:44.730
and threw a shot.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.972
People set goals, long
distance goals and shit.

00:00:47.972 --> 00:00:48.860
That's too much for me.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.942
I appreciate the support
of all the fans out here

00:00:50.942 --> 00:00:51.910
and all over the world.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.351
I never take it for granted.

00:00:53.351 --> 00:00:55.823
I use it as motivation, so.

00:00:55.823 --> 00:00:57.665
- He's an Irish mixed martial artist.

00:00:57.665 --> 00:00:59.699
He competes in the
Featherweight and Lightweight

00:00:59.699 --> 00:01:01.365
divisions of the UFC.

00:01:01.365 --> 00:01:03.670
He's the current UFC
Featherweight champion.

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:05.302
He's Conor McGregor and here are his

00:01:05.302 --> 00:01:07.045
Top 10 rules for success.

00:01:07.045 --> 00:01:10.207
(jet engine revving)

00:01:10.207 --> 00:01:15.139
- [Interviewer] What makes
you such a good fighter?

00:01:15.139 --> 00:01:19.895
- [Conor] I don't know,
I'm just curious about it.

00:01:19.895 --> 00:01:21.981
It's in my head 24/7.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:22.951
There's nothing else I can think.

00:01:22.951 --> 00:01:25.701
I don't think about nothing else.

00:01:26.541 --> 00:01:28.520
That's it, I'm just curious.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:30.154
Curiously fascinated, really, and I can't

00:01:30.154 --> 00:01:31.066
stop thinking about it.

00:01:31.066 --> 00:01:35.064
Everything I do in my
life is related to this.

00:01:35.064 --> 00:01:37.922
I don't do nothing else if it's
not got to do with fighting.

00:01:37.922 --> 00:01:38.755
Know what I mean?

00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:39.746
That is why.

00:01:39.746 --> 00:01:43.102
To be truth, all you got to do is show up.

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:46.003
- [Interviewer] Is that not unhealthy?

00:01:46.003 --> 00:01:48.342
- I don't know, do I look unhealthy?

00:01:48.342 --> 00:01:49.823
Take a look at this physique.

00:01:49.823 --> 00:01:52.231
I'm in phenomenal shape in body and mind.

00:01:52.231 --> 00:01:54.287
To me, what's unhealthy is
living an unhealthy life.

00:01:54.287 --> 00:01:56.496
To me, what's unhealthy is
getting up and going through

00:01:56.496 --> 00:01:58.804
the same day every day of your life 9 to 5

00:01:58.804 --> 00:01:59.887
in an office.

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:01.902
That's unhealthy.

00:02:01.902 --> 00:02:03.461
That beats your mind.

00:02:03.461 --> 00:02:04.954
I don't work.

00:02:04.954 --> 00:02:08.697
I love what I do and that's
why I'm doing what I love,

00:02:08.697 --> 00:02:09.530
know what I mean?

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:10.760
And that's why it's
become a career for me,

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:11.715
because I love it.

00:02:11.715 --> 00:02:14.845
I love what I do so I
don't think it's unhealthy.

00:02:14.845 --> 00:02:16.762
I feel good in my mind.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.718
It's my life.

00:02:19.718 --> 00:02:22.218
(Irish music)

00:02:23.104 --> 00:02:25.465
- [Commentator] Presents as well.

00:02:25.465 --> 00:02:27.229
- [Commentator] McGregor
really throwing the legs

00:02:27.229 --> 00:02:29.471
to the side landing a nice, big shot.

00:02:29.471 --> 00:02:31.986
- [Commentator] He's
trying to hurt Jahnsen

00:02:31.986 --> 00:02:32.826
with some shots.

00:02:32.826 --> 00:02:34.541
He's just covering at the moment.

00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:36.646
- [Commentator] Oh, lovely
left knee to the ribs.

00:02:36.646 --> 00:02:38.175
He was sitting in that
sideways position, but now just

00:02:38.175 --> 00:02:40.964
hitting the head and landing big strikes.

00:02:40.964 --> 00:02:42.445
It's going to McGregor.

00:02:42.445 --> 00:02:44.364
Jahnsen's going to have
to do something here.

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:45.272
- [Commentator] And that's it!

00:02:45.272 --> 00:02:46.835
Newhall has called a halt to this.

00:02:46.835 --> 00:02:50.376
Jahnsen was not intelligently
defending himself

00:02:50.376 --> 00:02:53.367
and Conor McGregor wins
by ground and pound

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:56.538
and asks for a reaction from
the crowd, which he gets.

00:02:56.538 --> 00:02:59.128
- You stare at your past and
you'll end up staying there.

00:02:59.128 --> 00:03:01.919
It's okay to look back and
admire it, but you carry on.

00:03:01.919 --> 00:03:06.102
I'm not in the business
of staring back at it,

00:03:06.102 --> 00:03:07.105
you know what I mean?

00:03:07.105 --> 00:03:07.938
And getting lost back there.

00:03:07.938 --> 00:03:11.105
People say a loss can
make or break a fighter,

00:03:11.105 --> 00:03:13.410
but trust me, a win can
also make or break a fighter

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:17.104
because they get comfortable with a win.

00:03:17.104 --> 00:03:20.986
People can get comfortable with a win and

00:03:20.986 --> 00:03:22.357
slack off then.

00:03:22.357 --> 00:03:24.369
Slack off on the training,
slack off on the diet.

00:03:24.369 --> 00:03:27.477
They've won one, they're winners now.

00:03:27.477 --> 00:03:28.310
That's not me.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.350
You sleep on a win and
you wake up with a loss,

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.601
so I just carry on, keep
doing what I'm doing.

00:03:34.601 --> 00:03:37.209
And that's why this
tournament is so good for me.

00:03:37.209 --> 00:03:38.712
Vegas straight away.

00:03:38.712 --> 00:03:41.281
The fighting Irish headed
to the fighting capital.

00:03:41.281 --> 00:03:42.502
It's perfect.

00:03:42.502 --> 00:03:44.801
Continue on this path, the freight train

00:03:44.801 --> 00:03:45.985
straight to the top.

00:03:45.985 --> 00:03:48.735
(dramatic music)

00:04:11.215 --> 00:04:14.412
If you can see it here and you have

00:04:14.412 --> 00:04:18.324
the courage enough to
speak it, it will happen.

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:22.754
So, I see these shots,
I see these sequences,

00:04:22.754 --> 00:04:24.667
and I don't shy away from them.

00:04:24.667 --> 00:04:26.783
A lot of times people
believe in certain things,

00:04:26.783 --> 00:04:28.645
but they keep to themselves.

00:04:28.645 --> 00:04:30.842
They don't put it out there.

00:04:30.842 --> 00:04:33.148
If you truly believe in it, if you become

00:04:33.148 --> 00:04:37.220
vocal with it, you're creating
that law of attraction

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:39.301
and it will become reality.

00:04:39.301 --> 00:04:43.859
I knew he would overextend
and I knew I'd catch him.

00:04:43.859 --> 00:04:46.482
So, Mystic Mike strikes again.

00:04:46.482 --> 00:04:48.186
(laughing)

00:04:48.186 --> 00:04:50.936
(dramatic music)

00:04:54.478 --> 00:04:58.613
(crowd yelling and applauding)

00:04:58.613 --> 00:05:01.364
(dramatic music)

00:05:01.364 --> 00:05:05.364
(crowd cheering and applauding)

00:05:06.837 --> 00:05:09.208
(whistling)

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:11.944
I'm enjoying the fruits of my hard work.

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:13.756
Nobody works harder than
me inside the octagon,

00:05:13.756 --> 00:05:15.641
outside the octagon.

00:05:15.641 --> 00:05:17.586
I am a work horse.

00:05:17.586 --> 00:05:19.922
So, I am going to enjoy
the benefits of this life.

00:05:19.922 --> 00:05:22.030
I am going to get myself a
big mansion in Las Vegas,

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.201
I'm going to get the soft top cars.

00:05:24.201 --> 00:05:25.630
I'm going to bring my whole team out.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:27.860
I'm going to spoil them
and give them this life.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.900
Big steaks that size we're eating

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:32.198
every single night each.

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:34.244
We're eating good, we're living good.

00:05:34.244 --> 00:05:36.223
It's human nature.

00:05:36.223 --> 00:05:38.973
Some people will sit and
take positivity from that.

00:05:38.973 --> 00:05:40.952
They will look at that
and take inspiration and

00:05:40.952 --> 00:05:44.190
it will inspire them to
go and push for that.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.078
Others will shell up and critique it

00:05:47.078 --> 00:05:49.599
and be negative towards it, but one thing

00:05:49.599 --> 00:05:50.432
is for sure.

00:05:50.432 --> 00:05:52.211
Those people will stay where they are.

00:05:52.211 --> 00:05:54.557
The people who take inspiration
from it will rise up

00:05:54.557 --> 00:05:57.328
and also one day experience that life.

00:05:57.328 --> 00:05:59.419
So, this is human nature.

00:05:59.419 --> 00:06:00.877
Some go one way, some go the other way,

00:06:00.877 --> 00:06:04.766
but I am enjoying my
money, my hard earned money

00:06:04.766 --> 00:06:07.071
that I have dedicated my life to.

00:06:07.071 --> 00:06:09.654
(upbeat music)

