00:15:05.707 --> 00:15:07.558
(crowd cheering)

00:15:07.558 --> 00:15:08.818
- [Commentator] With just a few shots

00:15:08.818 --> 00:15:11.602
Buchinger's completely out of it.

00:15:11.602 --> 00:15:12.929
- [Commentator] What a reaction!

00:15:12.929 --> 00:15:16.164
What a spectacular
knockout by Conor McGregor

00:15:16.164 --> 00:15:19.589
