00:15:37.597 --> 00:15:40.214
And on the balcony he has like Irish flags

00:15:40.214 --> 00:15:43.236
and a cardboard cutout of
me sitting on his balcony.

00:15:43.236 --> 00:15:45.298
So, now we're going to
go drop in to him and see

00:15:45.298 --> 00:15:47.253
