00:15:48.609 --> 00:15:49.567
- [Conor] What's up?

00:15:49.567 --> 00:15:50.734
- [Fan] Holy shit, man.

00:15:50.734 --> 00:15:51.567
- [Conor] How are you?

00:15:51.567 --> 00:15:52.459
- Good, how are you?

00:15:52.459 --> 00:15:53.491
- [Conor] Not bad.

00:15:53.491 --> 00:15:55.741
(laughing)

00:15:56.575 --> 00:15:57.722
- [Fan] This is awesome.

00:15:57.722 --> 00:15:58.825
