00:15:58.825 --> 00:16:00.426
I drove by a couple times and it's like,

00:16:00.426 --> 00:16:03.108
What the? I thought I was
seeing things at first.

00:16:03.108 --> 00:16:04.888
- [Fan] No, it's been up
since your Max Holloway

00:16:04.888 --> 00:16:05.853
fight, man. I set

00:16:05.853 --> 00:16:06.686
- No way.

00:16:06.686 --> 00:16:07.917
Are you looking forward
to the fight next week?

00:16:07.917 --> 00:16:08.750
