that's the best I can say.

00:16:50.346 --> 00:16:52.688
I'm enamored right now, man, I'm shaking.

00:16:52.688 --> 00:16:54.582
I'm acting like such a
little baby and crying.

00:16:54.582 --> 00:16:55.665
(laughing)

00:16:55.665 --> 00:16:57.208
- [Conor] I appreciate it, man.

00:16:57.208 --> 00:16:58.475
Honestly, I'm glad I could
make your day, alright?

00:16:58.475 --> 00:17:00.560
I appreciate the support
of all the fans out here

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:01.797
