00:17:30.155 --> 00:17:34.322
Conor McGregor is a UFC
Interim Featherweight Champion!

00:17:36.267 --> 00:17:38.267
- [Commentator] Wow, wow

00:17:39.283 --> 00:17:40.945
(crowd cheering)

00:17:40.945 --> 00:17:41.778
Wow.

00:17:44.363 --> 00:17:45.863
Wow, unbelievable.

00:17:50.975 --> 00:17:51.808
He did it.

00:17:59.029 --> 00:18:00.025
- Thank you so much for watching.

00:18:00.025 --> 00:18:03.747
I made this video because
Mr.13forTaylor asked me to.

00:18:03.747 --> 00:18:05.762
So, if there's a famous
entrepreneur that you want

