00:18:33.853 --> 00:18:36.271
Their mom and dad by their
side, encouraging it.

00:18:36.271 --> 00:18:38.462
I was never like that.

00:18:38.462 --> 00:18:40.656
That's going to go to the next level

00:18:40.656 --> 00:18:42.371
