encouraging the dream.

00:18:42.371 --> 00:18:46.600
Again, people can say
it's barbaric and martial

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.746
arts is barbaric, or this game

00:18:48.746 --> 00:18:49.913
it's too much.

00:18:51.088 --> 00:18:54.243
It's two men beating
each other or whatever.

00:18:54.243 --> 00:18:56.315
The martial arts life will
give you a discipline,

00:18:56.315 --> 00:18:57.994
will give you dedication,
will give you a drive

00:18:57.994 --> 00:18:59.866
that you won't get nowhere else.

00:18:59.866 --> 00:19:02.299
So, whatever these kids
that come in at that size

00:19:02.299 --> 00:19:03.919
with their parents,
whatever they decide to do,

00:19:03.919 --> 00:19:05.966
whether they decide to
conquer the martial arts

00:19:05.966 --> 00:19:08.190
world, the fighting game,
or whether they want

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:10.115
to go and conquer the business world.

00:19:10.115 --> 00:19:12.791
Whatever they decide to do,
training for combat sport,

00:19:12.791 --> 00:19:15.476
training martial arts will
give them that confidence

00:19:15.476 --> 00:19:16.857
to go and excel in anything.

00:19:16.857 --> 00:19:19.545
So, people can criticize
about it all they want,

00:19:19.545 --> 00:19:21.388
but the results speak for themselves.

00:19:21.388 --> 00:19:23.304
And seeing these little
kids coming in this size,

00:19:23.304 --> 00:19:26.637
it's good times, good times ahead I see.

